// A bare parameterized keyword: `Ward` is declared `Costed` (its macro's
// typed `params: [Cost]` — [CR#702.21a] "ward [cost]"), so a hand-written
// `Composite` spelling with no recorded invocation has LOST the cost — the
// use must invoke the keyword macro (`Keyword(Ward([...]))`) so the typed
// arg survives on the wire.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Bare Parameterized Ward",
  types: [Creature],
  abilities: [
    Keyword(Composite(name: "Ward", abilities: [])),
  ],
  power: 1,
  toughness: 1,
)
